# The extra packages of the deb13-clang CI image (see ci/images and the
# top of .gitlab-ci.yml), on top of common.packages: clang and its
# sanitizer runtimes for the sanitize-deb13 job (#15, ci/sanitize.sh).
# They are kept out of common.packages because make prefers clang when
# it is installed, and the build-* jobs build with gcc.
#
#   clang             the compiler (Debian's default version)
#   libclang-rt-dev   compiler-rt: the ASan/UBSan runtimes
#   llvm              llvm-symbolizer, for file:line in the reports
clang libclang-rt-dev llvm
